Date: Tue, 13 Aug 2024 17:30:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 269/572] feat(stm32mp2): add OTP mirror read code

Add code to read the OTP mirror area in SRAM1. This can be used when
Cortex-A35 is TDCID (OP-TEE fills the area) and also when Cortex-M33
is TDCID (done by TF-M).

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 9cc86590c9be8f5465ea40133737413adfaa1804 feat(stm32mp2): add OTP mirror read code]
Change-Id: I2641eaf31bea06c3db610aedca47905619978955
Signed-off-by: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/398287
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Maxime MERE <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
---
 plat/st/common/stm32mp_common.c             |  4 +++
 plat/st/stm32mp1/include/stm32mp1_private.h |  5 +++
